task cl3-1 state \\\"completed\\\" and the other four \\\"not-completed\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing in the search box and toggling filter chips updated the grid and the \\\"Showing X of Y\\\" count immediately with no submit button. \\\"Clear all filters\\\" restored venues to 8 of 8 (search input emptied, 8 cards) and vendors to 10 of 10.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Cancelled draft is not discarded; reopening the editor shows stale draft values instead of last saved values.\", \"actual\": \"Saved state was Alicia/Robert, 2028-09-30, 55500, 85. Edited to DraftName/99999/500 and clicked Cancel. Dashboard correctly stayed at \\\"Alicia & Robert\\\" / \\\"$55,500\\\" / \\\"85\\\". However, reopening the editor showed partnerOne=\\\"DraftName\\\", budget=\\\"99999\\\", guests=\\\"500\\\" — the cancelled draft, not the saved values. A subsequent Save would silently persist the abandoned edits.\", \"evidence\": \"Input values after reopen: {partnerOne:\\\"DraftName\\\", partnerTwo:\\\"Robert\\\", date:\\\"2028-09-30\\\", budget:\\\"99999\\\", guests:\\\"500\\\"}\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Dashboard shows couple \\\"Alicia & Robert\\\", formatted date \\\"Jun 12, 2027\\\", countdown \\\"288 days\\\", budget \\\"$55,500\\\", guests \\\"85\\\", progress \\\"0%\\\", and favorite/saved counts for venues (0 saved), vendors (0 saved), checklists (0 saved).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Venue card v1: type \\\"Garden\\\", price \\\"Luxury ($$$)\\\", name, location \\\"Napa Valley, CA\\\", rating 4.9, summary text, capacity \\\"Up to 200 guests\\\". Vendor card vn1: service \\\"Photography\\\", price, name, location \\\"Los Angeles, CA\\\", rating 4.9, summary, specialties (Candid Shots / Drone Photography / Same